<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The definitive edition:</strong> Based on the highly praised Oculus Quest version, now enhanced for PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical RPG gameplay:</strong> Command six unique characters, each with their own skills, across 26 missions and 60 handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging dystopian story:</strong> Unravel a tale of rebellion and survival, featuring voice acting by an All-Star Cast, including Kate Mulgrew, Nick Frost, and Garrick Hagon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Accessibility:</strong> Enjoy full controller support along with additional accessibility improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable progression:</strong> Develop your team\u2019s abilities and upgrades to suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of immersion:</strong> Enjoy up to 10 hours of gameplay packed with turn-based action and cyberpunk intrigue.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a long-time fan or a first-time player, experience <strong>Augmented Empire</strong> like never before. Are you ready to rise against the corrupt elite and reclaim New Savannah?</p>","developers":["Coatsink"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856600/header.jpg?t=1744812384","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Augmented Empire 2025. Published and developed under license by Coatsink Software Ltd. <br />\r\nAll other trademarks are the properties of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">